<title>USA: ATC Communications names CFO.</title>
<headline>ATC Communications names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>ATC Communications Group Inc said Thursday it appointed Matthew Waller as chief financial officer of ATC and its operating subsidiary, Advanced Telemarketing Corp.</p>
<p>Previous CFO Jerry Sims remains with the company as senior vice president and controller.</p>
<p>Before joining ATC, Waller spent four years with Principal Financial Securities Inc where his most recent position with the company was senior vice president in charge of the technology investment banking group, ATC said.</p>
